// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P141995453" "You're greeted at the door by Interrogator Kang, while in the distance you can hear someone talking about the 'evils of Praetoria'."
// Script Variable HERO_NAME :
"P2278530216" "Interrogator Kang"
// Script Variable HERO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P903950674" "{HeroName}, good to see you.<em>I don't know who these people are, but I intend to get to the bottom of it.<em>They've been causing problems throughout all of Praetoria, even attacking members of Powers Division, like yourself."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3211263678" "Activating emergency teleporter...!"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P1127431811" "Hello, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3809365136" "These fools, do they even know what they're talking about? They're the ones that are the threat!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3970005777" "Some of them doubt their cause. But I wonder, where do they come from? Who is this Ms. Liberty?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P198559400" "Hmph. I think I've seen these 'Arachnos' before. They think that we in the PPD are like them?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3691040249" "Hrm... Freedom Phalanx. I wonder, are these some sort of foreigners? Perhaps from the East?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P738017692" "That communicator of hers is interesting. This Longbow group is working with Arachnos?<em>All of them seek to bring chaos here to Praetoria. But why? There needs to be a good reason..."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P580602230" "What about jurisdiction?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P407799828" "It's one of the Praetorians!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2836562956" "<em><em>What about it? Look, Tyrant and his Praetorians are a threat to everyone, like Recluse. Someone needs to make a move."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Group1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P31420229" "The people here, they seem happy. Is this right for us to be here?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3622459616" "We won't let you Praetorians continue to serve this Tyrant!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2265533824" "<em><em>Don't be fooled. We've got direct orders from Ms. Liberty to do what we can here, even if the others won't."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Group2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3221780211" "All I'm saying is that their police force, by in large, are using non-lethal weapons. Look at what we're equipped with!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P665056024" "<em><em>Don't be fooled, they're corrupt, just like Arachnos. You need to wait and see."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1597956467" "Here's a Praetorian now, take them down!"

