"P226494484" "When are we getting back up? From the Freedom Phalanx?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P435299329" "We can handle the likes of you, Praetorian!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2516168092" "<em><em>It's too risky for them to make an appearance just yet."

