// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2397474550" "Take down the group's leader"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3918654835" "You defeated the Longbow Officer and found some information on her communicator."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3137962990" "You've managed to stabilize the situation in Anti-Matter's lab!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2611186412" "My researchers are starting to flood back into the lab. Good job. That's one task off my list of a hundred things to get done by the end of the day. You found information about this Longbow group working with Arachnos? Ugh...<br><br><color orange>Anti-Matter groans and begins to pace back and forth.</color><br><br>This is going to lead back to me, {HeroName}, I <i>know</i> it. Sure, why don't we ask <i>Anti-Matter</i> to take care of it, he's not a Praetor anymore, he has <i>all</i> the time in the world! It's not like I'm <i>still</i> being ordered to do <i>everything</i> else while that brat Berry just continues screwing around. {HeroName}, I think I'm going to need your help some more, because if Cole expects me to protect Praetoria on top of <i>everything</i> else I'm doing, then it's going to be up to you to get that part done."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3744478196" "How familiar are you with Arachnos? Well, I hope enough to fight them, because I have no time to give you a history lesson on what they're about. I've just been given the word that <i>I'm</i> supposed to deal with the Arachnos threat here in Neutropolis. Of course, why not? I've got plenty of time to handle that. At the very least, Cole has Praetor White dealing with the issue of Longbow, though he'll probably just send the issue over to one of the other Powers Division. I'm really the only one of the Praetors who takes responsibility for what needs to be done.<br><br>At any rate, there's a report that Arachnos has taken over an office building nearby, claiming they're fighting for the Resistance or some stupidity like that. Do you think you can go in there and handle the situation? Arachnos have already killed several office workers and my intel says they're planning on blowing up that building. The last thing I need right now is for a building to get blown up on <i>my</i> watch."
// AcceptString :
"P3046673901" "I'll make sure nothing bad happens."
// SendOffString :
"P2474875202" "Good. Now, look, just be careful when you're going in there, alright? I don't need you dying when you and I have a whole slew of things to take care of."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3376450355" "Fend off Arachnos!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P302717507" "{HeroName}, <i>please</i> tell me you didn't forget what you need to do. I'm in the middle of ten different things right now, I can't really drop any of them to explain to you what you <i>should</i> be doing."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3998065722" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Foreign Technology</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1049427597" "You saw several injured office workers outside of the building. As you walked in, they all cheered for you and your victory over Arachnos."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2607790909" "Four minutes to de-activate the Arachnos teleporter"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1490326749" "We just need to set the Rikti bomb and get going. We've got full control over it now."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2606771671" "It's a Praetorian! Today's your unlucky day, friend!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1523635598" "<em><em>If you say so. I still believe we need to use some of this new stuff the Praetorians have."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2462372561" "You're not walking out of here alive!"

