"P2354485488" "You deactivated the Arachnos machine, but was it too late?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4079117849" "You hear the rumors? About another Arachnos operation going on here?"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4290686493" "One of those Praetorians! Let's add them to the body count!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1172488461" "<em><em>I did, but we can't be concerned about that right now. We've got our orders, back the Resistance, take down Cole."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1926916743" "When are we getting reinforcements? The lines are getting kind of thin here."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P552807652" "We've taken down plenty of Destined Ones, let's get ourselves a Praetorian!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1148027933" "<em><em>Sands said once they get the tech back up they'll be sending more in."

