"P2939420487" "Interrogator Kang greets you as you enter the warehouse, full of Arachnos and Resistance."
// Script Variable HERO_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3819958407" "Glad you made it, {HeroName}.<em>Things are starting to connect with Arachnos, Longbow, and Cole.<em>But first, we need to make sure these 'Destined Ones' don't try to harm anyone else."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P642846412" "Sorry, but you'll need to handle things from here!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4093523671" "That woman seemed like she was quite insane. Are these the kind of people that Arachnos is employing?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2027851815" "Are these Destined Ones willfull allies or forced to do this against their will?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3950591054" "That... was odd. These seem to be the type of people Arachnos favors in their employ."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2265772222" "These Resistance punks never cease to amaze me with their language."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
